# ENC-TSK-P83: cross-Lambda module sharing manifest (honored by _build.yml).
# The docstore_integrity detector's I-D6 invariant reuses document_api's
# shared Markdown outline parser unmodified (outline.compute_outline), so the
# outline this Lambda recomputes from the current S3 body matches document_
# api's own manifest.outline byte-for-byte. Declared here so `from outline
# import compute_outline` resolves at runtime; keep in lockstep with the
# canonical owner (backend/lambda/document_api/outline.py).
backend/lambda/document_api/outline.py
# DVP-TSK-B17 (isolation W4e, DOC-EF4BC758CCC9): the dual-path S3 helper, copied to the function root by
# .github/workflows/_build.yml so `import content_store` resolves. Canonical copy lives in the shared layer.
backend/lambda/shared_layer/python/enceladus_shared/content_store.py
